=== ARTICLE: Bodies and genitals ===
[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy@8dbfadad254d1073a017109fcbfda9f966b8dd74/docs/img/lining.jpg[/img][/center]

[size=4][b]Bodies and genitals[/b][/size]
One line each: the feature, and the hard thing it solved.

[list]
[*][b]Dynamic labia.[/b] No skeleton women load has genital bones, and shipping one would fight every skeleton mod. Anatomy adds 9 bones at run time, under whatever skeleton loaded: inner lips that part around what enters (collision spheres of 1.7 units), outer lips that jiggle softer.
[*][b]A real lining inside (new).[/b] The canal used to sample one texel: a flat colour. Now it has its own seamless unwrap (198 vertices) and a painted mucosa with 14 folds, wet near the entrance. The vulva is untouched.
[*][b]A closed anal canal.[/b] Looking into the anus no longer shows the inside of the body.
[*][b]Working openings on YOUR CBBE.[/b] Nahka's geometry, fitted to your own CBBE; the shared skin stays byte-identical, so every outfit and preset still fits.
[*][b]Their own shape and material.[/b] Separately textured genitals; your own skin everywhere else.
[*][b]Light textures.[/b] 53 MB down to 3 MB, Steam Deck friendly.
[*][b]Anatomy on 3BBB (new).[/b] 3BBB moves the breasts on its own bones and CBBE's weights fight it. The builder now builds on 3BBB when you have it and keeps those bones.
[*][b]Hip and neck.[/b] A softer pelvis-to-thigh handover on the body, and on your built CBBE outfits with AnatomyRebuild; the neck ring faces the way the head does.
[/list]
[i]The two pre-built bodies on the Files tab were built with Anatomy 1.1.1: no vaginal lining. Run the AnatomyBuilder for it.[/i]

=== ARTICLE: The physics engine ===
[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-ocbpc@5b6d9837d62b2c86fc7e26e83d6282d1e7e8f185/docs/img/skirt.jpg[/img][/center]

[size=4][b]The physics engine[/b][/size]
The Anatomy Engine is our own build of OCBPC (cbp.dll).

[list]
[*][b]One smooth tube.[/b] A chain of spheres snags on the lips and lets things slip between the balls. Every penis and toy collides as one tube.
[*][b]Stretch.[/b] Openings widen to fit what is inside, fisting and toys included.
[*][b]Contact without jitter (new).[/b] Tight contact acts as a constraint, so nothing shakes when it squeezes.
[*][b]Skirt physics, follow mode (new in 1.2.4).[/b] Skinning cannot drape, so legs pass through coats and dresses. The engine hangs 60 bones at the hips (12 around × 5 down) and, since 1.2.4, each one rides the legs instead of swinging; cloth hugging the hips moves like the skin. Legs through a tight dress, crouching / sitting / striding: 24 / 25 / 20 % → 2 / 5 / 1 %. For Anatomy Tailor's coats and dresses installed with that option. The whole story: the article "Skirt physics: cloth that follows the legs".
[*][b]Every loaded actor[/b], and right after a ragdoll.
[*][b]Its own physics preset[/b] when you have none, following the body the AnatomyBuilder built (CBBE or 3BBB).
[*][b]A health check (new).[/b] About 10 s after every load, Anatomy_Health.txt names the engine, the preset and who it covers, the body and whether its weights match, the builder's stamp, every simulated actor and the sounds. A box appears only when something is really wrong.
[*][b]The AE crash family, fixed.[/b] Run-time nodes started with garbage reference counts and were freed under the body's skin; they are now zeroed first.
[*][b]One cbp.dll[/b] for 1.10.163 and the Anniversary Edition, through Runtime Database. Nothing of another mod is overwritten.
[/list]

